#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:292
msgid "Worksheets and the Menubar"
msgstr "Kalkylblad och menyraden"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:294
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> provides a number of options for "
"manipulating worksheets as a whole, rather than the contents of the "
"worksheets. These operations are documented in the later section <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-worksheets-managing-process-contextmenu\"/>. In addition to "
"the worksheet tab context menu and the <guimenuitem>Sheet</guimenuitem> "
"submenu of the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu, some of these operations are "
"also available from other menus:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> har flera alternativ för att hantera "
"kalkylblad som helhet, inte bara deras innehåll. Dessa åtgärder beskrivs "
"längre fram i <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-managing-process-"
"contextmenu\"/>. Förutom kalkylbladets snabbmeny och undermenyn "
"<guimenuitem>Blad</guimenuitem> i menyn <guimenu>Redigera</guimenu> finns "
"vissa av åtgärderna även i andra menyer:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:305
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Insert</guilabel> function is also available as "
"<guimenuitem>Sheet</guimenuitem> on the <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen <guilabel>Infoga</guilabel> finns även som "
"<guimenuitem>Blad</guimenuitem> i menyn <guimenu>Infoga</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:311
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Rename</guilabel> and <guilabel>Manage Sheets</guilabel> "
"dialogs are also available on the <guimenuitem>Format ▶ Sheet</guimenuitem> "
"submenu."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutorna <guilabel>Byt namn</guilabel> och <guilabel>Hantera "
"blad</guilabel> finns även i undermenyn <guimenuitem>Format ▶ "
"Blad</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:319
msgid ""
"In addition to worksheet manipulation, <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"provides the ability to control various aspects of how or whether a "
"worksheet is displayed in the cell grid. Several such controls are included "
"in the <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-managing-process-dialog\"/>, "
"described in a later section. Other worksheet display controls are located "
"in the <xref linkend=\"format-menu-sheet\"/> submenu, which are described "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Förutom att hantera kalkylblad kan du i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"styra olika aspekter av om och hur ett kalkylblad visas i cellrutnätet. "
"Flera sådana inställningar finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-managing-"
"process-dialog\"/>, som beskrivs längre fram. Andra visningsinställningar "
"för kalkylblad finns i undermenyn <xref linkend=\"format-menu-sheet\"/> och "
"beskrivs där."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:332
msgid "Worksheet Tab Context Menu"
msgstr "Snabbmeny för kalkylbladsflik"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:334
msgid ""
"Except for the addition of the two <guimenuitem>Select</guimenuitem> "
"submenus, which appear only on the context menu, this is the same as the "
"<guimenuitem>Edit ▶ Sheet</guimenuitem> submenu. The <guimenuitem>Manage "
"sheets...</guimenuitem> dialog is discussed in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-managing-process-dialog\"/>, which follows the description of the"
" context menu."
msgstr ""
"Bortsett från de två undermenyerna <guimenuitem>Markera</guimenuitem>, som "
"bara finns i snabbmenyn, motsvarar den här menyn undermenyn "
"<guimenuitem>Redigera ▶ Blad</guimenuitem>. Dialogrutan <guimenuitem>Hantera"
" blad...</guimenuitem> beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-managing-"
"process-dialog\"/>, efter genomgången av snabbmenyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:360
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Insert</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to insert a new, "
"empty worksheet ahead of the current worksheet. The new worksheet is the "
"same size as the current one."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Infoga</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet om du vill"
" infoga ett tomt kalkylblad före det aktuella. Det nya kalkylbladet får "
"samma storlek som det aktuella."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:367
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Append</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to add a new, "
"empty worksheet at the end of the existing worksheets. The new worksheet has"
" the default size, which can be set in the <guilabel>Gnumeric "
"Preferences</guilabel> dialog in the “Windows” tab."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Lägg till</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet om du "
"vill lägga till ett tomt kalkylblad sist bland de befintliga kalkylbladen. "
"Det nya kalkylbladet får standardstorleken, som kan anges på fliken "
"”Fönster” i dialogrutan <guilabel>Gnumeric-inställningar</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:377
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Duplicate</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to add a copy "
"of the selected worksheet immediately after the selected worksheet."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Duplicera</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet om du "
"vill lägga till en kopia av det markerade kalkylbladet direkt efter det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:384
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Remove</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to delete the "
"selected worksheet."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Ta bort</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet om du "
"vill ta bort det markerade kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:390
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Rename</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to access the "
"<guilabel>Rename Sheet</guilabel> dialog, which lets you change the name of "
"a single worksheet. To rename more than one worksheet, the <guilabel>Manage "
"Sheets</guilabel> dialog may be more convenient."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Byt namn</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet för att "
"öppna dialogrutan <guilabel>Byt namn på blad</guilabel>, där du kan ändra "
"namnet på ett kalkylblad. Om du vill byta namn på flera kalkylblad kan "
"dialogrutan <guilabel>Hantera blad</guilabel> vara smidigare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:399
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Resize...</guimenuitem> — Select this menu item to access the "
"<guilabel>Resize Sheet</guilabel> dialog. Use the sliders to adjust the size"
" of the sheet, then click <guilabel>OK</guilabel>. Worksheet dimensions are "
"restricted to powers of two. By default the <guilabel>Resize "
"Sheet</guilabel> dialog changes the sizes of all worksheets in the current "
"workbook. To change the size of a single worksheet, clear the check mark "
"next to <guilabel>Apply change to all sheets</guilabel> before clicking "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Ändra storlek...</guimenuitem> — Välj det här menyalternativet "
"för att öppna dialogrutan <guilabel>Ändra storlek på blad</guilabel>. "
"Justera bladets storlek med skjutreglagen och klicka sedan på "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel>. Bladets mått måste vara potenser av två. Som "
"standard ändrar dialogrutan <guilabel>Ändra storlek på blad</guilabel> "
"storleken på alla kalkylblad i den aktuella arbetsboken. Om du bara vill "
"ändra storleken på ett blad avmarkerar du rutan bredvid <guilabel>Använd "
"ändringen på alla blad</guilabel> innan du klickar på "
"<guilabel>OK</guilabel>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:413
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Select</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Select "
"(sorted)</guimenuitem> — Select one of these menu items to access a menu of "
"worksheet names. Click on one of the names to select that worksheet. The "
"displayed tabs are adjusted so that the selected worksheet's tab is visible,"
" and the selected worksheet is displayed in the cell grid."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Markera</guimenuitem> och <guimenuitem>Markera "
"(sorterade)</guimenuitem> — Välj ett av dessa menyalternativ för att visa en"
" meny med kalkylbladens namn. Klicka på ett namn för att välja kalkylbladet."
" Flikarna justeras så att det valda kalkylbladets flik blir synlig, och "
"kalkylbladet visas i cellrutnätet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:429
msgid "Manage Sheets dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Hantera blad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:431
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Manage Sheets</guilabel> dialog can be accessed from the "
"worksheet tab context menu, from the <guimenuitem>Edit ▶ Sheet</guimenuitem>"
" submenu, or from the <guimenuitem>Format ▶ Sheet</guimenuitem> submenu."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <guilabel>Hantera blad</guilabel> kan öppnas från "
"kalkylbladsflikens snabbmeny, undermenyn <guimenuitem>Redigera ▶ "
"Blad</guimenuitem> eller undermenyn <guimenuitem>Format ▶ "
"Blad</guimenuitem>."
